  <section>
    <prefix>Regulation</prefix>
    <num>.06</num>
    <heading>Identification as Polysomnographic Technologist; Notice of Name or Address Change.</heading>
    <para>
      <num>A.</num>
      <text>A licensed polysomnographic technologist shall wear an identification tag or a badge <strong>[</strong>which identifies that individual as<strong>]</strong> <em>displaying in readily visible type that the individual is</em> a licensed polysomnographic technologist.</text>
    </para>
    <para>
      <num>B.</num>
      <text>
        <em>An individual may not identify himself or herself as a polysomnographic technologist unless the individual is licensed by the Board.</em>
      </text>
    </para>
